iziosi, dote che sfrutta per preparare il pranzo al ragazzo per cui ha una cotta. La sua semplice vita quotidiana viene stravolta del tutto quando viene rapita con la forza e trascinata in un inquietante mondo di gioco. Insieme a Pechka, sono sedici le ragazze magiche radunate lì. In questo spazio virtuale artificiale, si alza in silenzio il sipario su un incubo tanto splendido quanto crudele.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11651324/screencap/6ac3e4b0d31b1.jpg"},{"title":"The Players","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17839","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"160803","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54344","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"457780","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"110559","synopsis":"Sixteen magical girls have been assembled in a vast virtual world. The electronic fairy Fal announces a team competition with a 10-billion-yen grand prize, where players must collect “Candy.” With Pechka panicking over her complete lack of combat ability, Clantail takes the lead in redistributing the Candy. But could this become the seed of quiet mistrust among the group?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12020951/screencap/6acd1976c153a.jpg"},{"title":"Episode 3","titleKey":"Episode {{number}}","titleParams":{"number":"3"},"episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"link":"110761"},{"title":"Episode 4","titleKey":"Episode {{number}}","titleParams":{"number":"4"},"episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"link":"110881"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":160803,"malId":54344},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:160803","mal:54344"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17839","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-2":"1-2"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"160803","ranges":{"1-2":"1-2"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"54